# Microsoft Office lock files, written beside an open document and deleted on close.
# One was committed by a `git add -A` that swept the working tree; it is 165 bytes of
# machine-local state naming whoever had the deck open.
~$*

# Browser-automation scratch, and screenshots taken while checking something by hand. Both are
# session artefacts that land in the working directory and have no business in the repository —
# nine of them reached main in one commit because a `git add -A` ran where they were sitting.
.playwright-mcp/
check*.png
